    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d109-a1-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0181" n="181" sameAs="frus:frus1861/pg181"/>

                <head>[Indorsement by Captain Adams.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1861-06-10"><hi rendition="#small-caps">June</hi> 10,
                        1861</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>At the time the Perthshire was boarded from this ship and ordered off from
                    Pensacola there was no blockade of Mobile or the Mississippi river.</p>
                <closer><signed>H. A. ADAMS,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Captain U. S. Frigate
                            “Sabine.”</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
